# Timing Benchmark
# Tests timing accuracy with various duration formats

# Millisecond timing
wait 500ms
wait 750ms
wait 1000ms

# Second timing
wait 1s
wait 1.5s
wait 2s
wait 2.5s

# Minute timing
wait 0.5m
wait 1m

# Mixed operations with timing
effect Light Scanlines
wait 100ms

effect Heavy Scanlines
wait 100ms

effect None
wait 100ms

# Rapid palette changes
palette colodore
wait 50ms

palette vice
wait 50ms

palette pepto_ntsc
wait 50ms

palette colodore
wait 50ms

# Final confirmation
wait 1s

stop
